Not used: Vorssaint's mascot, name, icons, strings, artwork or any other asset. Ox comes from OXBOT's
design/logo/ox-mascot.svg; agent marks are read at run time from the makers' installed apps. Not ported:
brightness, screenshots/recording, clipboard history, notifications, calendar, downloads, lyrics, queue, mixer,
lock screen, prices, update checks.

